te": "2023-02-11"}, {"category": "game", "period": "day", "rank": 4, "date": "2023-01-13"}, {"category": "game", "period": "week", "rank": 10, "date": "2023-01-19"}, {"category": "game", "period": "month", "rank": 28, "date": "2023-02-02"}], "images": {"main": "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_main.jpg", "thumb": "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_main_240x240.jpg", "samples": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp3.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp4.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp5.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp6.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp3_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp4_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp5_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01015000/RJ01014404_img_smp6_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "Heroine Conquest [BadColor]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "", "body": [{"intro": "Language: ENG, JAP<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(R18) このゲームは性的描写や異種姦を含んでいます。このゲームの登場人物は全て18歳以上です。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n魔王はヒロインたちによって倒されました。<br />\r\nあなたは魔王軍を指揮し、ヒロインを捕らえて繁殖させなければいけません。<br />\r\nヒロインたちを征服し、魔王が再びこの地を支配する手助けをしましょう。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nシンプルなポイント&amp;クリックゲームに、ユニット強化システムを搭載。<br />\r\nラウンドごとにユニットを強化することで、ヒロイン捕獲の可能性が高まります。<br />\r\nシンプルな配置システムを使用し、少ない試行回数でヒロインを捕獲するためのベストな戦略を見つけてください。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n高画質なアニメーションもお楽しみください。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n操作方法:<br />\r\nマウスとキーボードを使用。<br />\r\nalt + enter でフルスクリーンに切り替わります。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nバグや問題が発生した場合は、コメントを残してください。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(18+)This game contains strong sexual and interspecies content. All characters depicted are 18+ of age.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Demon Lord has been defeated by the Heroines. It is now up to you to command the evil troops to capture the Heroines and breed them. Conquer the Heroines and help the Demon Lord reign over the lands again.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA simple point and click game, with a unit upgrading system. Upgrade your units after every round, to further increase your chance of capturing the Heroine. Using a simple placement system, find the best strategy to capture the heroines with the least amount of tries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing fully high resolution animated scenes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\nMouse and keyboard.<br />\r\nalt +enter to toggle full screen.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease leave a comment, on any bugs and problems you encounter.<br />\r\nJoin the discord server, for unanswered questions and information on any future upcoming projects."}]}], "description": "シンプルなポイント&クリックゲームに、ユニット強化システムを搭載。", "short_introduction": "シンプルなポイント&クリックゲームに、ユニット強化システムを搭載。", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01014404.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794954390}